          {
            "description": "cmd+tab -> F18/F19/F20 for AeroSpace. macOS consumes cmd+tab in the WindowServer, above global hotkeys, so AeroSpace never sees it. Karabiner is below the WindowServer. No app exclusions: this is window management, wanted everywhere.",
